        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Paul Maynard, Theresa May, Margaret Thatcher\n- Roles: Rail minister, Prime Minister of the United Kingdom, Leader of the Conservative Party\n- Organizations: Conservative Party\n- Places: United Kingdom\n\nFacts:\n- Theresa May was born on 1 October 1956.\n- Since 2016, Theresa May has served as Prime Minister of the United Kingdom and Leader of the Conservative Party.\n- Since 2016, Theresa May has been the second woman to hold both the offices of Prime Minister of the United Kingdom and Leader of the Conservative Party, after Margaret Thatcher.\n- In July 2016, Paul Maynard became rail minister after Theresa May entered office as the new Prime Minister.",
